440
00:45:02,000 --> 00:45:10,720
But what we've noticed is that this often inflates a lot of the engagement metrics that you obviously want to measure when you launch a new feature.

441
00:45:11,440 --> 00:45:20,480
So we've actually taken the opposite approach where we'll roll out a new feature, we won't say anything, and we'll just see how the metrics do on its own.

